{"seq":3,"slug":"modularization-strategies","title":"模块化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/modern-patterns/modularization-strategies","wordCount":1205,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"模块化策略\">模块化策略</h1><p>当移动应用的代码量超过 50 万行、参与开发的工程师超过 20 人时，单模块 monolith 的构建时间、合并冲突频率和认知负荷会达到一个临界点。模块化不是&quot;把文件分到不同文件夹&quot;——它是通过<strong>编译边界</strong>将代码切割为独立的构建单元，使团队可以并行开发、独立测试、按需加载。2026 年的工业界数据显示，大型移动团队（Airbnb、Uber、SoundCloud）普遍采用 50-200 个模块的拓扑结构，构建时间改善 40-70%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>编译边界隔离</strong>：模块化不是&quot;文件夹分组&quot;，而是通过编译单元边界强制依赖方向，违规会导致编译失败</li>\n<li><strong>Feature 间零依赖</strong>：Feature 模块之间不得直接依赖，通过 core 层接口或导航契约通信</li>\n<li><strong>微应用加速开发</strong>：每个 Feature 模块可独立构建为 Demo App，将构建时间从分钟级降到秒级</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要模块化\">为什么需要模块化</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>痛点</th>\n<th>单模块</th>\n<th>模块化后</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量构建时间</td>\n<td>5-15 分钟</td>\n<td>增量构建 &lt; 30 秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI 时间</td>\n<td>测试全跑</td>\n<td>只跑受影响模块的测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并冲突</td>\n<td>高频（共享文件多）</td>\n<td>低频（模块边界清晰）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码归属</td>\n<td>模糊</td>\n<td>CODEOWNERS 按模块分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新人认知负荷</td>\n<td>需要理解全局</td>\n<td>只需理解负责的模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态下发</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>Android Dynamic Feature / iOS On-Demand Resource</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三种模块化拓扑\">三种模块化拓扑</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 按层分模块&#10;        A1[app] --&gt; P1[presentation]&#10;        P1 --&gt; D1[domain]&#10;        D1 --&gt; DA1[data]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 按特性分模块&#10;        A2[app] --&gt; F1[feature-home]&#10;        A2 --&gt; F2[feature-search]&#10;        A2 --&gt; F3[feature-cart]&#10;        F1 --&gt; C2[core]&#10;        F2 --&gt; C2&#10;        F3 --&gt; C2&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 混合拓扑&#10;        A3[app] --&gt; FF1[feature-home]&#10;        A3 --&gt; FF2[feature-search]&#10;        FF1 --&gt; DOM[domain]&#10;        FF2 --&gt; DOM&#10;        DOM --&gt; DAT[data]&#10;        FF1 --&gt; UI[ui-components]&#10;        FF2 --&gt; UI&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 按层分模块\n        A1[app] --&gt; P1[presentation]\n        P1 --&gt; D1[domain]\n        D1 --&gt; DA1[data]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 按特性分模块\n        A2[app] --&gt; F1[feature-home]\n        A2 --&gt; F2[feature-search]\n        A2 --&gt; F3[feature-cart]\n        F1 --&gt; C2[core]\n        F2 --&gt; C2\n        F3 --&gt; C2\n    end\n\n    subgraph 混合拓扑\n        A3[app] --&gt; FF1[feature-home]\n        A3 --&gt; FF2[feature-search]\n        FF1 --&gt; DOM[domain]\n        FF2 --&gt; DOM\n        DOM --&gt; DAT[data]\n        FF1 --&gt; UI[ui-components]\n        FF2 --&gt; UI\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"按层分模块-layered\">按层分模块（Layered）</h3><p>将 Clean Architecture 的每一层做成独立模块。优点是层间依赖规则在编译期强制执行；缺点是一个新 Feature 需要在 4 个模块中各加文件，垂直切片能力弱。</p>\n<h3 id=\"按特性分模块-feature-based\">按特性分模块（Feature-based）</h3><p>每个 Feature 是一个自包含模块，内含自己的 UI + 逻辑 + 数据访问。优点是团队可以整个 Feature 交付、独立测试；缺点是公共逻辑的复用需要抽到 core 模块。</p>\n<h3 id=\"混合拓扑-推荐\">混合拓扑（推荐）</h3><p>大多数成功的大型应用采用混合方案：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>模块</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Feature 模块</mtext><mo>∪</mo><mtext>核心模块</mtext><mo>∪</mo><mtext>基础设施模块</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{模块} = \\text{Feature 模块} \\cup \\text{核心模块} \\cup \\text{基础设施模块}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">模块</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Feature </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">模块</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">核心模块</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">基础设施模块</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模块类型</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>依赖规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Feature</td>\n<td><code>feature-home</code>, <code>feature-checkout</code></td>\n<td>只依赖 core + 基础设施，<strong>不依赖其他 Feature</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Core / Domain</td>\n<td><code>core-model</code>, <code>core-data</code>, <code>core-network</code></td>\n<td>只依赖基础设施</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础设施</td>\n<td><code>infra-analytics</code>, <code>infra-logging</code>, <code>ui-design-system</code></td>\n<td>叶子模块，无业务依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>App Shell</td>\n<td><code>app</code></td>\n<td>依赖所有 Feature，负责导航拼接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>黄金规则：Feature 模块之间不得直接依赖。</strong> 如果 Feature A 需要 Feature B 的数据，通过 core 层的接口通信，或通过导航传参。违反这条规则会重新引入耦合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模块间通信模式\">模块间通信模式</h2><p>Feature 之间需要通信但不能直接依赖——解决方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 方案1：Navigation Contract（推荐）&#10;// 在 core-navigation 模块定义路由契约&#10;interface NavigationContract {&#10;    fun productDetail(productId: String): NavRoute&#10;    fun checkout(cartId: String): NavRoute&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 方案2：Service Locator / DI&#10;// 在 core 模块定义接口，Feature 模块实现并注册&#10;interface CartService {&#10;    fun getCartItemCount(): Flow&lt;Int&gt;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// feature-cart 模块提供实现&#10;class CartServiceImpl @Inject constructor(...) : CartService { ... }&#10;&#10;// feature-home 模块消费接口&#10;class HomeViewModel @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val cartService: CartService  // 注入接口，不知道实现&#10;) : ViewModel() { ... }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 方案1：Navigation Contract（推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 core-navigation 模块定义路由契约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface NavigationContract {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun productDetail(productId: String): NavRoute</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun checkout(cartId: String): NavRoute</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 方案2：Service Locator / DI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 core 模块定义接口，Feature 模块实现并注册</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface CartService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getCartItemCount(): Flow&#x3C;Int></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// feature-cart 模块提供实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class CartServiceImpl @Inject constructor(...) : CartService { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// feature-home 模块消费接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class HomeViewModel @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val cartService: CartService  // 注入接口，不知道实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() { ... }</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    FH[feature-home] --&gt;|依赖接口| CN[core-navigation]&#10;    FC[feature-cart] --&gt;|依赖接口| CN&#10;    FC --&gt;|实现| CS[CartService impl]&#10;    FH --&gt;|消费| CSI[CartService interface]&#10;    CSI -.-&gt;|定义在| CORE[core-domain]&#10;    CS -.-&gt;|注册到| DI[DI Graph]&#10;    FH -.-&gt;|注入自| DI\">flowchart TD\n    FH[feature-home] --&gt;|依赖接口| CN[core-navigation]\n    FC[feature-cart] --&gt;|依赖接口| CN\n    FC --&gt;|实现| CS[CartService impl]\n    FH --&gt;|消费| CSI[CartService interface]\n    CSI -.-&gt;|定义在| CORE[core-domain]\n    CS -.-&gt;|注册到| DI[DI Graph]\n    FH -.-&gt;|注入自| DI</pre><h2 id=\"android-模块化实践\">Android 模块化实践</h2><p>Android 使用 Gradle 模块，每个模块是一个独立的 <code>build.gradle.kts</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// settings.gradle.kts&#10;include(&quot;:app&quot;)&#10;include(&quot;:feature:home&quot;)&#10;include(&quot;:feature:search&quot;)&#10;include(&quot;:feature:cart&quot;)&#10;include(&quot;:core:model&quot;)&#10;include(&quot;:core:data&quot;)&#10;include(&quot;:core:network&quot;)&#10;include(&quot;:core:ui&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// settings.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":app\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":feature:home\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":feature:search\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":feature:cart\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":core:model\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":core:data\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":core:network\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":core:ui\")</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>构建优化关键指标：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>增量构建时间</mtext><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mtext>变更模块的依赖者数量</mtext><mtext>并行构建槽数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{增量构建时间} \\propto \\frac{\\text{变更模块的依赖者数量}}{\\text{并行构建槽数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">增量构建时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">并行构建槽数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">变更模块的依赖者数量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>减少模块的&quot;扇出&quot;（fan-out，被其他模块依赖的数量）是构建优化的关键。<code>core-model</code> 通常扇出最大——修改它会触发大量模块重编译，因此应保持极度稳定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ios-模块化实践\">iOS 模块化实践</h2><p>iOS 使用 Swift Package Manager（SPM）或 Tuist 管理模块依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Package.swift（SPM 模块化）&#10;let package = Package(&#10;    name: &quot;FeatureHome&quot;,&#10;    platforms: [.iOS(.v17)],&#10;    products: [&#10;        .library(name: &quot;FeatureHome&quot;, targets: [&quot;FeatureHome&quot;])&#10;    ],&#10;    dependencies: [&#10;        .package(path: &quot;../CoreDomain&quot;),&#10;        .package(path: &quot;../CoreUI&quot;)&#10;    ],&#10;    targets: [&#10;        .target(name: &quot;FeatureHome&quot;, dependencies: [&quot;CoreDomain&quot;, &quot;CoreUI&quot;]),&#10;        .testTarget(name: &quot;FeatureHomeTests&quot;, dependencies: [&quot;FeatureHome&quot;])&#10;    ]&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Package.swift（SPM 模块化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> package</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    platforms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">iOS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.v17)],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    products</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">library</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../CoreDomain\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../CoreUI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CoreDomain\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CoreUI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">testTarget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHomeTests\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>iOS 模块化的工具选择（2026 年）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SPM</td>\n<td>Apple 官方、Xcode 原生集成</td>\n<td>大型项目解析慢、缺 build 缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tuist</td>\n<td>自动生成 Xcode 项目、依赖图可视化</td>\n<td>额外工具链依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CocoaPods + 子模块</td>\n<td>遗留项目兼容</td>\n<td>已不推荐用于新项目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"微应用-micro-app-模式\">微应用（Micro-app）模式</h2><p>微应用是模块化的极致形式：每个 Feature 模块可以独立编译为一个&quot;迷你 App&quot;，用于加速开发和测试：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>开发者只构建自己负责的 Feature + core 依赖</strong>——构建时间从 5 分钟降到 20 秒</li>\n<li><strong>QA 可以针对单个 Feature 做集中测试</strong>——无需走完整应用流程</li>\n<li><strong>Demo app 供设计师/PM 查看独立 Feature</strong>——无需登录、无需完整后端</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"feature-checkout/&#10;├── src/main/         # Feature 源码&#10;├── src/test/         # 单元测试&#10;├── demo-app/         # 独立可运行的 Demo App&#10;│   └── DemoActivity  # 注入假数据，直接展示 Checkout 流程&#10;└── build.gradle.kts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>feature-checkout/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── src/main/         # Feature 源码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── src/test/         # 单元测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── demo-app/         # 独立可运行的 Demo App</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── DemoActivity  # 注入假数据，直接展示 Checkout 流程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── build.gradle.kts</span></span></code></pre></div><p>模块化策略决定了应用的工程治理结构。它与 <a href=\"../cross-cutting/dependency-injection-mobile\">依赖注入</a> 紧密配合——DI 框架是让模块之间通过接口而非实现通信的基础设施；也与 <a href=\"../cross-cutting/navigation-routing-patterns\">导航路由</a> 密不可分——Feature 模块不直接引用目标页面，而是通过路由契约间接跳转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>模块化是应对移动应用规模化的结构性解决方案。混合拓扑（Feature + Core + 基础设施）是被大型团队验证有效的默认选择。其黄金规则——Feature 间零依赖——需要 DI 框架和导航契约作为运行时支撑。微应用模式是模块化的极致形态，通过为每个 Feature 提供独立 Demo App 将开发反馈周期压缩到秒级。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模块化策略","id":"模块化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要模块化","id":"为什么需要模块化"},{"level":2,"text":"三种模块化拓扑","id":"三种模块化拓扑"},{"level":3,"text":"按层分模块（Layered）","id":"按层分模块-layered"},{"level":3,"text":"按特性分模块（Feature-based）","id":"按特性分模块-feature-based"},{"level":3,"text":"混合拓扑（推荐）","id":"混合拓扑-推荐"},{"level":2,"text":"模块间通信模式","id":"模块间通信模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Android 模块化实践","id":"android-模块化实践"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 模块化实践","id":"ios-模块化实践"},{"level":2,"text":"微应用（Micro-app）模式","id":"微应用-micro-app-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MVI 与 Redux 移动端实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/modern-patterns/mvi-redux-mobile"},"next":{"title":"移动端依赖注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting/dependency-injection-mobile"}}